# Twi (Akan) translations for the Newlife AG Church App's public pages.
#
# This is a first-pass, best-effort translation of the public-facing
# navigation/labels covered so far (home, sermons, events, giving) - it was
# written without a fluent Twi speaker's review, so please have someone
# from the congregation who speaks Twi check it over before relying on it
# for a live service. See "Multi-language support (Twi/English)" in
# README.md for how to add more translated strings or fix any of these.
