msgstr "Akwaaba Wɔ Newlife AG"

msgid "An Assemblies of God church in Tema. Join us for a service, catch up on the latest sermon, or give online - all in one place."
msgstr "Yɛyɛ Assemblies of God asɔre a ɛwɔ Tema. Bɛka yɛn ho wɔ ɔsom mu, tie asɛnka a aba nnansa yi, anaasɛ fa Intanɛt so ma w'akyɛde - biara wɔ ha."

