msgstr "Nhyiamu biara nni hɔ ɛnnɛ."

msgid "Back to all events"
msgstr "San Kɔ Nhyiamu Nyinaa Ho"

msgid "RSVP"
msgstr "Ka Sɛ Wobɛba"

msgid "Volunteer Slots"
msgstr "Adwumayɛ A Wɔhwehwɛ Adwumayɛfoɔ"

msgid "Full"
msgstr "Ayɛ Ma"

msgid "No volunteer slots for this event yet."
msgstr "Adwumayɛ biara nni hɔ ma nhyiamu yi ɛnnɛ."

msgid "All slots are currently full."
msgstr "Adwumayɛ nyinaa ayɛ ma seesei."

msgid "Register"
msgstr "Kyerɛw Wo Din"

msgid "Sold out"
msgstr "Atɔn Nyinaa"

msgid "Reserve your spot"
msgstr "Si Wo Beaeɛ"

msgid "All ticket types are currently sold out."
msgstr "Ticket nyinaa atɔn seesei."

msgid "See current giving campaigns"
msgstr "Hwɛ Akyɛde Mmɔden A Ɛrekɔ So"

msgid "No smartphone or data handy? Text"
msgstr "Wonni smartphone anaa data? Kyerɛw Text"

msgid "(e.g. \"GIVE 50\") to"
msgstr "(sɛnea ɛte \"GIVE 50\") kɔ"

msgid "to give by SMS instead."
msgstr "na fa SMS so ma mmom."

msgid "You'll be redirected to a secure Flutterwave page to complete your gift."
msgstr "Wɔde wo bɛkɔ Flutterwave krataa a ɛyɛ security ma woawie w'akyɛde no."

msgid "Online payments aren't turned on yet, so this records your gift as"
msgstr "Wɔmmaa Intanɛt so sika tua kwan so ɛnnɛ, enti eyi bɛkyerɛw w'akyɛde sɛ"

msgid "pending"
msgstr "ɛrehwɛ hɔ"

msgid "for an admin to follow up on. It will switch to processing real payments automatically once Flutterwave is configured."
msgstr "ama admin bi ahwɛ mu. Sɛ wɔhyɛ Flutterwave anan a, ɛbɛsesa akɔ sika tua ankasa so."

msgid "More"
msgstr "Bio"

msgid "Planning a Visit?"
msgstr "Woredwene Sɛ Wobɛba?"

msgid "What to Expect"
msgstr "Deɛ Wobɛhunu"

msgid "Current Campaign"
msgstr "Mmɔden A Ɛrekɔ So Seesei"

msgid "raised of"
msgstr "a wɔanya afiri"

msgid "goal"
msgstr "botaeɛ"

msgid "raised so far"
msgstr "a wɔanya abesi ɛnnɛ"

msgid "Give to this Campaign"
msgstr "Ma Kɔ Saa Mmɔden Yi So"

msgid "Get Connected"
msgstr "Ka Wo Ho Bɔ"

msgid "Find a group meeting near you and grow together in community."
msgstr "Hwehwɛ kuw a ɛbɛn wo na yɛn nyinaa nnyin bom."

msgid "Ask the church to stand with you in prayer, or pray for someone else's request."
msgstr "Bisa asɔre no sɛ wɔne wo nnyina mpaeɛbɔ mu, anaasɛ bɔ obi foforɔ abisadeɛ ho mpaeɛ."

msgid "Read stories of answered prayer and God's work in our members' lives."
msgstr "Kenkan nsɛm a ɛfa mpaeɛbɔ a wɔagye so ne Onyankopɔn adwuma a ɔyɛ wɔ yɛn asɔremma nkwa mu ho."

msgid "A church member"
msgstr "Asɔremma bi"

msgid "Live Now"
msgstr "Ɛrekɔ So Seesei"

msgid "Live Soon"
msgstr "Ɛrebɛfiti Nnansa Yi"

msgid "Get to Know Us"
msgstr "Sua Yɛn Ho"

msgid "Get the Link"
msgstr "Nya Link No"

msgid "Watch the Replay"
msgstr "Hwɛ No Bio"

msgid "Watch Now"
msgstr "Hwɛ Seesei"


# --- Giving page redesign & thank-you page (first pass - please have a
# --- fluent Twi speaker review these too) ---

msgid "Tithes &amp; Offerings"
msgstr "Ntotosoɔ ne Ayɛyɛdeɛ"

msgid "Give generously, worship joyfully"
msgstr "Fa ayamye ma, som wɔ anigye mu"

msgid "Your generosity supports our ministries, outreach and the work of the Gospel in Tema and beyond. Thank you for partnering with Newlife AG."
msgstr "Wo ayamye boa yɛn asɔre dwumadie, nsɛmpa ka ne Asɛmpa adwuma wɔ Tema ne baabi foforɔ. Yɛda wo ase sɛ wo ne Newlife AG yɛ adwuma."

msgid "Each of you should give what you have decided in your heart to give, not reluctantly or under compulsion, for God loves a cheerful giver."
msgstr "Obiara mma sɛdeɛ ɔde n'akoma asi so, ɛnyɛ awerɛhoɔ so anaa ahiadeɛ so, ɛfiri sɛ Onyankopɔn dɔ obi a ɔde anigyeɛ ma."

msgid "God loves a cheerful giver."
msgstr "Onyankopɔn dɔ obi a ɔde anigyeɛ ma."

msgid "Online payments are not yet active."
msgstr "Intanɛt so sika tua nnyɛ adwuma seesei."

msgid "Your gift will be recorded as pending and a member of our finance team will follow up with you."
msgstr "Yɛbɛkyerɛw w'akyɛdeɛ no sɛ ɛretwɛn, na yɛn sikasɛm kuo no mu nipa bi bɛkasa akyerɛ wo."

msgid "Choose an amount"
msgstr "Paw sika dodoɔ"

msgid "Or enter another amount"
msgstr "Anaa kyerɛw sika dodoɔ foforɔ"

msgid "What is this gift for?"
msgstr "Saa akyɛdeɛ yi yɛ deɛn ho?"

msgid "Giving campaign"
msgstr "Akyɛdeɛ dwumadie"

msgid "Leave as General fund unless you are giving toward a specific project."
msgstr "Gyae no sɛ General fund gye sɛ woreyi ama adwuma pɔtee bi."

msgid "Your details"
msgstr "Wo ho nsɛm"

msgid "Give as"
msgstr "Ma sɛ"

msgid "Choose your name to include this gift on your giving statement, or give anonymously."
msgstr "Paw wo din na yɛde saa akyɛdeɛ yi aka wo akyɛdeɛ krataa ho, anaa ma a wonnkyerɛ wo din."

msgid "Full name"
msgstr "Wo din nyinaa"

msgid "Email address"
msgstr "Email address"

msgid "Phone number"
msgstr "Fon nɔma"

msgid "optional"
msgstr "ɛho nhia"

msgid "Used only to confirm your gift. Anonymous gifts are never shown publicly."
msgstr "Yɛde di dwuma sɛ yɛbɛsi w'akyɛdeɛ no pi nko ara. Yɛnkyerɛ akyɛdeɛ a din nni so wɔ baguam da."

msgid "Continue to secure payment"
msgstr "Kɔ so kɔtua sika wɔ ahobanbɔ mu"

msgid "Record my gift"
msgstr "Kyerɛw m'akyɛdeɛ"

msgid "Payments are processed securely by Flutterwave. Card and Mobile Money accepted."
msgstr "Flutterwave na ɛhwɛ sika tua no so wɔ ahobanbɔ mu. Yɛgye Card ne Mobile Money."

msgid "Other ways to give"
msgstr "Akwan foforɔ a wobɛfa so ama"

msgid "Text to give"
msgstr "Fa nkra (SMS) ma"

msgid "Text"
msgstr "Kyerɛw"

msgid "to"
msgstr "kɔ"

msgid "&mdash; no data needed."
msgstr "&mdash; wonhia data."

msgid "Recurring giving"
msgstr "Akyɛdeɛ a ɛtaa ba"

msgid "Set up a regular gift and we'll remind you when it's due."
msgstr "Hyehyɛ akyɛdeɛ a wobɛtaa ama na yɛbɛkae wo berɛ a ɛduru."

msgid "Set up recurring giving"
msgstr "Hyehyɛ akyɛdeɛ a ɛtaa ba"

msgid "Giving campaigns"
msgstr "Akyɛdeɛ dwumadie ahodoɔ"

msgid "Support a building fund, missions or special project."
msgstr "Boa adansie sika, asɛmpa ka anaa adwuma soronko bi."

msgid "View current campaigns"
msgstr "Hwɛ dwumadie a ɛkɔ so seesei"

msgid "Giving statement"
msgstr "Akyɛdeɛ krataa"

msgid "View, print or email a record of your gifts."
msgstr "Hwɛ, tintim anaa fa w'akyɛdeɛ nkrataa kɔ email so."

msgid "View my statement"
msgstr "Hwɛ me krataa"

msgid "Give with confidence"
msgstr "Fa ahotoso ma"

msgid "We never store your card or Mobile Money details."
msgstr "Yɛnkora wo card anaa Mobile Money ho nsɛm da."

msgid "Members with an email on file receive a receipt for each completed gift."
msgstr "Asafomma a wɔn email wɔ yɛn nkyɛn nya rehyit ma akyɛdeɛ biara a ɛwie."

msgid "Questions? Our finance team is happy to help."
msgstr "Wowɔ asɛmmisa? Yɛn sikasɛm kuo no ani bɛgye sɛ wɔbɛboa wo."

msgid "Contact us"
msgstr "Kasa kyerɛ yɛn"

msgid "Thank you"
msgstr "Yɛda wo ase"

msgid "Thank you!"
msgstr "Yɛda wo ase!"

msgid "Thank you for your gift!"
msgstr "Yɛda wo ase wɔ w'akyɛdeɛ no ho!"

msgid "Your payment was successful."
msgstr "Wo sika tua no akɔ yie."

msgid "A confirmation has been sent to your email."
msgstr "Yɛde nsɛm a ɛsi no pi akɔma wo wɔ wo email so."

msgid "Payment not completed"
msgstr "Sika tua no nwieeɛ"

msgid "We couldn't confirm this payment. If money left your account, please contact the church office with the reference below."
msgstr "Yɛantumi ansi saa sika tua yi pi. Sɛ sika firii wo akawnt mu a, yɛsrɛ wo kasa kyerɛ asɔre ofese no na fa reference a ɛwɔ aseɛ ha no ka ho."

msgid "Almost there"
msgstr "Aka kakra"

msgid "We're waiting for confirmation of your payment. If you paid with Mobile Money, approve the prompt on your phone; your gift will be confirmed automatically."
msgstr "Yɛretwɛn sɛ wɔbɛsi wo sika tua no pi. Sɛ wode Mobile Money tuaa a, pene nkra a ɛba wo fon so no so; yɛbɛsi w'akyɛdeɛ no pi ankasa."

msgid "Your gift has been recorded and a member of our finance team will follow up with you to complete it."
msgstr "Yɛakyerɛw w'akyɛdeɛ no, na yɛn sikasɛm kuo no mu nipa bi bɛkasa akyerɛ wo na woawie."

msgid "Gift type"
msgstr "Akyɛdeɛ su"

msgid "Campaign"
msgstr "Dwumadie"

msgid "Date"
msgstr "Da"

msgid "Reference"
msgstr "Reference"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "Tebea"

msgid "View receipt"
msgstr "Hwɛ rehyit"

msgid "Refresh status"
msgstr "San hwɛ tebea"

msgid "Try again"
msgstr "San bɔ mmɔden"

msgid "Back to home"
msgstr "San kɔ fie"
